---
description: Server telemetry invariants for route handlers and spans
globs: server/src/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

Every route handler wraps work in `withApiSpan` from `server/src/telemetry/withApiSpan.ts`.

Use attribute keys prescribed in `.cursor/skills/server-telemetry/SKILL.md`. Do not log PII or high-cardinality attributes.

See `.cursor/skills/server-telemetry/SKILL.md` for examples and call shape.
